<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20931" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρενθύομαι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span> (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρᾰχῠ-ύνομαι</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			11.305
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Pall.
		</span></i>)), only pres. and impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bear oneself haughtily, hold one's
				head high, swagger</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ φρονήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				362
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				221b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				10.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					887
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. τι πρὸς αὑτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					54
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἐπί τινι</span>
			<i>plume oneself</i> on . . , <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.625b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐβρενθύετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					56.17
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				1.14
			</span></i>; also, <i>take umbrage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. καὶ ἀγανακτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					5.36
				</span></i>
			. (Either from 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρένθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			 or from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρένθειος</span>, as <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.37
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				887
			</span></i>.)</div>
